     "text": "{\"reachable\": false, \"rationale\": \"With h1_0:obtain and h2_2:obtain blocked, all three routes to crown:obtain fail. h3_2:reach depends only on h2_2:obtain, so it is unreachable. That makes h4_1:obtain (AND, needs h3_2) and h4_2:obtain (AND, needs h2_2 and h3_2) unreachable. As a result, h5_0:pivot (needs h4_1) and h5_1:pivot (AND, needs h4_2) are unreachable. h2_1:escalate (AND, needs h1_0) is unreachable, so h3_0:escalate is too. h5_2:escalate therefore has neither parent (h3_0, h3_2). With no parent of crown:obtain reachable, the target cannot be reached.\"}"
